  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OIC: Trade and market intelligence for ICDT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen ICDT services on trade intelligence to support the public and private sector from the Organisation of Islamic Cooperation (OIC) to make better informed decisions and, in the long term, to contribute to an increase of trade between OIC Member States through the embedding of Market Analysis Tools, the development of an online Trade Helpdesk and the development of trade-related studies.</narrative>
  </description>
